{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261028/photo/bkn-20261028101016179-1028_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261028105717\"/><p>女途人倒地受傷，動彈不得。</p><p>油麻地發生交通意外。今晨(28日)9時許，一名女子於文昌街近文成街交界，懷疑橫過馬路期間，意外被一輛駛至的客貨車撞倒。女途人倒地受傷，動彈不得。救援人員接報到場，將頭傷清醒的女事主交由救護車送院治理，意外原因有待調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T03:01:24.260179+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T02:10:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T11:38:14.776806+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T02:58:29.345288+00:00","content_hash":"5e4ff12f762117c1de85a6c6ef9c31d5f756a7549bf2138d54230ca1dbda44e8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T03:01:24.260179+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}